# UBSan's run-time suppressions for the sanitizer lane, built with
# -Pgoldberry.media.sanitize=address,undefined. Every other report is fatal.
#
# Each line is undefined behaviour in an upstream's own C, found by the lane,
# that every compiler here turns into the two's-complement arithmetic the code
# means. They are the upstreams' to fix; a line comes out when a pin that
# fixes it goes in.

# libvorbis 1.3.7, vorbis_book_init_decode: `i << (32 - dec_firsttablen)` on an
# int, for the decode table of every codebook of a valid stream.
shift-base:sharedbook.c

# libFLAC 1.5.0, FLAC__lpc_restore_signal: the 32-bit LPC sum of a damaged
# frame overflows. The frame fails its CRC either way.
signed-integer-overflow:lpc.c
